  "review": {
    "summary": "The subset defines strong fail-closed artifact, command, credential, and verification boundaries, but two material implementation gaps remain: the raw-ARIA fallback does not enforce its documented DNS snapshot boundary, and unresolved imported test bindings can become unsuppressible P0 findings in Cypress-proven files.",
    "scores": {
      "semantic_correctness": 89,
      "false_positive_control": 81,
      "security_trust_boundaries": 79,
      "verification_design": 93,
      "scope_contract_consistency": 92,
      "docs_usability": 90
    },
    "findings": [
      {
        "severity": "H",
        "category": "security_trust_boundaries",
        "file": "skills/playwright-test-generator/scripts/raw-aria-snapshot.cjs",
        "line": 92,
        "title": "Raw-ARIA routing does not enforce approved DNS peers",
        "evidence": "The request guard checks only the request URL against the approved textual origin before continuing it. The helper receives no approved-peer snapshot and performs no address pinning or drift check, despite the public contract requiring snapshot drift to fail closed. A later localhost resolution can therefore escape the peer identity established by preflight.",
        "recommendation": "Restrict this fallback to canonical numeric loopback literals and reject localhost, or run it behind a transport boundary that pins every browser connection to the preflight peer set and verifies drift before navigation."
      },
      {
        "severity": "H",
        "category": "false_positive_control",
        "file": "skills/e2e-reviewer/scripts/scan.sh",
        "line": 3232,
        "title": "Unresolved imported test receiver is accepted as focused-test evidence",
        "evidence": "focused_test_hit_matches returns success when the receiver is imported from an unresolved package. In a file already considered Cypress-proven by path or basename, the later file-level provenance gate can promote this binding-unresolved match to a final, unsuppressible #7 P0 rather than LLM triage, allowing an unrelated imported API named test.only to fail the scan.",
        "recommendation": "Keep unresolved imported receivers in the non-gating P0-candidate ledger until their binding resolves to Playwright test; accept Cypress test/it/describe only when they are unimported, unshadowed Cypress globals."
      }
    ],
